EbbTop third-party notices
==========================

This file lists the crates compiled into the EbbTop desktop application and
monitoring agent, with the license each carries, followed by the full text of
every license — as those licenses require. EbbTop itself is MIT-licensed; its
text is in the LICENSE file in the repository and beside the downloads. The
bundled Noto Sans SC and Noto Sans TC fonts are SIL OFL 1.1; their license
ships beside the executable (LICENSE-OFL.txt) and is readable inside the
application, and the fonts epaint compiles in are covered by OFL-1.1 and the
Ubuntu Font Licence below.

Generated from Cargo.lock with cargo-about; the configuration and template
live in deploy/third-party/. Regenerate this file in the same commit as any
dependency change.

